# Web dependencies for the hosted-contract job in .github/workflows/hosted.yml.
# The direct pins come from hosted/requirements.txt (the Space runtime pins), so
# CI tests the versions the Space installs. The workflow fails if the installed
# versions differ from those pins (step "Verify the lock matches the Space runtime pins").
# Regenerate the hash-locked file after editing either file:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 requirements/ci/hosted-contract.in -o requirements/ci/hosted-contract.txt
-r ../../hosted/requirements.txt
